   Freudenstein, F.; Croft, R. J.; Loughran, S. P.; Wiedemann, P. M., Univ Wollongong, Illawarra Hlth \& Med Res Inst, Australian Ctr Electromagnet Bioeffects Res, Wollongong, NSW, Australia.
   Freudenstein, F.; Wiedemann, P. M., Monash Univ, Fac Med Nursing \& Hlth Sci, Sch Publ Hlth \& Prevent Med, Dept Epidemiol \& Prevent Med, 553 St Kilda Rd, Melbourne, Vic 3004, Australia.
